sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Passenger (Web)
    participant F as FastAPI
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant A as Admin (Desktop)

    P->>F: POST /api/bookings/:id/refund
    F->>DB: Check booking status = CONFIRMED
    F->>DB: UPDATE status = REFUND_REQUESTED
    F-->>P: 200 {status: REFUND_REQUESTED}

    Note over DB: Booking awaits admin review

    A->>DB: Admin opens refund queue
    DB-->>A: List of REFUND_REQUESTED bookings
    A->>A: Review + approve

    alt Refund approved
        A->>DB: UPDATE status = REFUNDED, refund_amount = X
    else Refund rejected
        A->>DB: UPDATE status = CONFIRMED
    end

    P->>F: GET /api/bookings/my
    F->>DB: Query
    DB-->>F: Updated booking
    F-->>P: Show new status